{"title":"Dune Alpha","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .15</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>31</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>21</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td>31</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dune-alpha?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>21</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 3 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link quest\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 4 total, 2 per drop - Quest item: Goats on the Rock\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"quest-tag\" title=\"Quest item\">Q</span><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 3 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dune-alpha-hide\" title=\"Dune Alpha Hide - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/06d4d7f57b1ebe34de06.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Alpha Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 67% of 3 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">67% · 2/3</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 103 total, 103 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/3</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-legs\" title=\"Bearhide Legs - in 33% of 3 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d5f0c0f64a5f6fd492e9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">33% · 1/3</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Inferior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-604.9px,-624.0px)\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"tiles/3/3/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:583.3px;top:666.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:591.4px;top:660.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:577.6px;top:629.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:585.4px;top:647.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:608.6px;top:624.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:579.1px;top:609.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:587.6px;top:618.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:590.0px;top:598.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:580.6px;top:639.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:571.8px;top:599.5px\"></i><i style=\"left: